# Turnstone — what stays out of the repository
#
# Short on purpose. The rule is not "ignore generated files" — those are committed here
# deliberately (the standalone build, the port payloads, the fixtures, the crawl files),
# because a single-file app and a drag-install bookmarklet only work if the bytes are in
# the repo. This file is for two narrower things: **planning documents** that are kept
# locally and deliberately not published, and **tool scratch** that no reader should ever
# see in a diff.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ planning docs ---
# The master/product documents are planning artefacts, not product. They are kept on the
# author's disk and read by whoever is doing the planning; the published sources of truth
# are README.md, agents.md, todo.md and history.md. Removing one from tracking is
# `git rm --cached <file>` — it must already be tracked for this line to do anything.
PRD-Turnstone.md
PRD-*.md
*-PRD.md
planning/
notes/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------- tooling ---
# Agent/thread metadata (this directory records which workspace a session belonged to).
.freebuff/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------ system ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
